cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "OMF Atlas: an interactive 3D atlas of oral and maxillofacial anatomy"
message: "If you use this software or its teaching material, please cite it as below."
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Sofi-Mahmudi
    given-names: Ahmad
    email: ahmad.pub@gmail.com
    alias: choxos
repository-code: "https://github.com/choxos/OMFAtlas"
url: "https://omfatlas.xera.ac"
abstract: >-
  An interactive browser atlas of oral and maxillofacial anatomy for dental
  education. It renders 643 head and neck meshes extracted from BodyParts3D,
  together with 77 schematic nerve, vessel, gland, sinus and joint structures
  that the source dataset does not contain, whose courses are fitted at run
  time to landmarks measured on the loaded meshes. It also provides a
  schematic 3D tooth and periodontium cutaway, a root canal configuration
  explorer, and a tooth development section covering odontogenesis, eruption
  chronology and developmental anomalies. It is an educational reference and
  is not intended for diagnosis or treatment planning.
keywords:
  - anatomy
  - dental education
  - oral and maxillofacial anatomy
  - odontogenesis
  - 3D visualization
  - open educational resources
license: MIT
